  "GLB glass is opaque reflective; GLB textures 1K to meet the 50 MB ceiling",
  "1x file scale is 28 m; 4-5x/16-25x tiers are art direction, documented in scale_study",
  "Full 789 MB .blend is local-only; scripts rebuild it",
  "K014/K034 low-res source textures were replaced with the scene KB3D PBR sets",
  "Modelshop Greebles is only partially downloaded and was not used",
  "Preview screenshots are SwiftShader/WebGL captures at 1600x1000"
